<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Cali Realty Corp was not available for after-hours trading due to news pending.</p>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said earlier in the day that it had filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $1 billion in preferred and common stocks and warrants.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland's preferred A stock were not available for trading.</p>
